This application uses modified PI-Desktop presentation source. Electron IPC,
workspace plugins and persistence bindings are replaced by Pi Web browser
adapters. No original session storage, model settings or tool execution code
is replaced. Sources and modification hashes are included beside this notice.

Presentation includes the original turn/activity disclosures, thinking row,
structured tool details, text shimmer, smooth streaming, syntax highlighter,
Chinese labels and locally scoped original token/message/prose styles.
A browser-only focus adaptation prevents pointer focus from opening a closed
row before its first click; the original reading protection remains intact.
